This is part of my project of designing a computer from the ground up, in which I completely design much of the circuitry and code. This is the step where I create a compiler to compile a custom low-level programming language into a custom assembly language.

> [!NOTE]
>
> This project is developed on [Codeberg](https://codeberg.org/oldnews/compiler/)
> and is mirrored on [GitHub](https://github.com/old-news/compiler)
